  "title": "Linguine with Broccoli and Red Peppers",
  "description": "Linguine with broccoli and red peppers get sautéed in olive oil and garlic, then topped with Parmesan cheese for a quick, delicious meal or side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Chris Catley"
  ],
